<section id="command" style="max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 24px 96px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px">
  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; align-items: center; text-align: center">
    <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 48px); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.025em">Open any change from the terminal.</h2>
    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; color: var(--fg-2); max-width: 34rem">Installing adds a <code style="font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 15px">collate</code> command. It can also be your git difftool and mergetool.</p>
  </div>
  <ul class="shell cmds" style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 4px 20px; border-radius: 16px">
    <li style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 24px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 16px 4px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; min-width: 140px">This repository</span><span style="flex: 1 1 220px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--fg-3)">Its changes, refreshed as you edit.</span><code class="inset" style="font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px 10px">$ collate</code></li>
    <li style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 24px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 16px 4px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; min-width: 140px">A range</span><span style="flex: 1 1 220px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--fg-3)">A branch against another, or any commit.</span><code class="inset" style="font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px 10px">$ collate main..topic</code></li>
    <li style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 24px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 16px 4px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; min-width: 140px">History</span><span style="flex: 1 1 220px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--fg-3)">The commit graph, ready to browse.</span><code class="inset" style="font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px 10px">$ collate --history</code></li>
    <li style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 24px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 16px 4px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; min-width: 140px">Two folders</span><span style="flex: 1 1 220px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--fg-3)">Two files or two folders, compared.</span><code class="inset" style="font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px 10px">$ collate old/ new/</code></li>
    <li style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 24px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 16px 4px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; min-width: 140px">A patch</span><span style="flex: 1 1 220px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--fg-3)">From a file, or piped in.</span><code class="inset" style="font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px 10px">$ git diff | collate</code></li>
  </ul>
</section>
